      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "A red giant: a helium core inside a hydrogen shell. It brings a second gauge, §bΘ (core heat)§r, which runs away on its own.\n\n§e§lUNLOCK§r The milestones are §b1,000,000 L ESPM§r and §b3 h Resonant§r on Sirius A. Then:\n- put the §bShell-Burning Core§r in escrow;\n- build the §bjet crescent§r (stack 3: 2,750 Jet Crescent Casing; the beam band must stand too);\n- bring compression to 3 and buffer §b250,000 L ESPM§r;\n- swap in §bStar Chart: Arcturus§r.\n§bShell Ignition§r (10 min): Θ appears and ramps up, and the event ends in one forced helium flash.\n\n§e§lRUN§r Arcturus takes §b12,500,000 L H + 12,500,000 L He + 1,250 L ESPM§r a cycle and makes §b625 L Raw Hyperdense Stellar Plasma§r.\n\n§e§lTRIMS§r\n- Helium: P −1, Θ +3.\n- Hydrogen: P +3, Θ +0.5.\n- Super Coolant (100 L): P −1, Θ −3.\nTo pull P down without heating the core, dose Helium §land§r coolant together.\n\n§e§lHELIUM FLASHES§r Every 20-40 minutes a flash adds §bΘ +30 a second for 3 s§r. The sensor's event channel warns §b15 s ahead§r. Pre-cool on the warning and you stay Stable.\n\n[note]The T4 milestones: §l400,000 L RHSP§r, §l4 h Resonant§r, and §l3 flashes ridden§r without leaving Stable.[/note]\n\n§a§lDONE WHEN§r you hold the core and the chart (HOLD → CLAIM → INSTALL: claim before the core goes into escrow).",
